You brace yourself for the final stand, increasing Defense and Armor by [8, 10, 12, 14, 15 (TL1-5; DEX 100; CON 100)], maximum and current life by [166, 235, 287, 331, 368 (TL1-5; DEX 100; CON 100)], but making you unable to move.

Your stand lets you concentrate on every blow, allowing you to avoid death from normally fatal wounds. You can only die when reaching [-166, -235, -287, -331, -368 (TL1-5; DEX 100; CON 100)] life.

If your life is below 0 when Last Stand ends it will be set to 1.

The increase in Defense and Armor is based on your Dexterity, and the increase in life is based on your Constitution and normal maximum life.
